---@field station? LuaEntity
---Only used if `type` is [station](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/defines.html#defines.cargo_destination.station). Must be connected to the station and not reserved.
---@field hatch? LuaCargoHatch
---Only used if `type` is [station](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/defines.html#defines.cargo_destination.station) or [surface](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/defines.html#defines.cargo_destination.surface). If true, items with [rocket\_launch\_products](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemPrototype.html#rocket_launch_products) defined will be transformed into their products before starting descent. Defaults to `false`.
