---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/concepts.html#SoundType)
---@alias SoundType ("game-effect")|("gui-effect")|("ambient")|("environment")|("walking")|("alert")|("wind")|("world-ambient")|("weapon")|("explosion")|("enemy")

